description_a:
Kindly Please help help for this issue : PASS 4614@id.panasonic.com  (Karya Pendingin) 
Is Cannot request approval for warranty discounts over 1 year, error appears as follows,
This is the step For Check : 
1).Open Work Order and Click Submit For Approval ; 
2).Click Submit; 
3).Appear Error : This Approval Request Requires The Next Approver To Be Determined By The Discount Approver Field. This Value Is Empty. Please Contact Your Administrator For More Information; 
