description_b:
The following Genesis Partner Portal account missing Sales Office.
Sales Office and SMAP indicator is present in SAP. 
Their SO failed to transmit to SAP. 
Please sync Sales Office of the following accounts and their affected SO,
1. account = DEVOCION, ALEXES NOYNA; Sap customer code = 5000025993;
2. account = ALVAREZ, RONNEL MIRADORA; Sap customer code = 5000026883;

Many PASDL vendors in the SAP system are no longer in use, user would like to know the difference of MK05 and MK06 from below aspects, thanks.

1.	The operation method;
2.	The usage scenario;
3.	The impacts to other programs/functions(such as vendors price, application of procurement related data such as POs);
4.	If you have other suggestions please share together.
